   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48C1

   1 a 0000 E48C1:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P2c] THE CONTROL of this bank: the flat-cell SCVCM store re-measured
   4 a 0006 inside the E48C battery.  P1 predicts it keeps E48A6 0013's
   5 a 0006 17-byte `LXI H,lit / LXI D,var' so every other row here differs by
   6 a 0006 ONE axis. */
   7 c 0006   dcl b bit(1) static initial('0'b);
   8 c 0006   dcl name char(30) varying;
   9 c 0006   name = 'AB';
  10 c 0013   b = (name = 'EOF');
  11 c 0024   put list('B=', b);
  12 c 0046   stop;
  13 a 0049 end E48C1;

CODE SIZE = 0049
DATA AREA = 0027
FREE SYMS = 3884
END  COMPILATION
